---
title: "reserve repay_amount (Current Finance: Reserve)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_calc_repay: repay_decimal = from(coin.value)
    q_calc_repay --> q_check_overpay: debt lt repay_decimal?
    q_check_overpay --> q_overpay: overpayment path
    q_check_overpay --> q_normal: normal repay path

    q_overpay --> q_ceil_debt: total_debt = debt.ceil()
    q_ceil_debt --> q_calc_excess: excess = coin.value - total_debt
    q_calc_excess --> q_add_reserve: cash_reserve += excess
    q_add_reserve --> q_zero_debt: debt = 0
    q_zero_debt --> q_deposit: deposit_underlying(coin)
    q_deposit --> [*]

    q_normal --> q_sub_debt: debt = debt - repay_decimal
    q_sub_debt --> q_deposit_normal: deposit_underlying(coin)
    q_deposit_normal --> [*]

    note right of q_check_overpay
        INV-001: Overpayment excess treated as donation to cash_reserve
        INV-002: debt uses Decimal (fractional), coin.value is integer
        INV-003: ceil() rounding means repayer may pay slightly more than exact debt
        INV-004: cash increases by full coin.value regardless of overpay
    end note
